Resistor color codes
Code  Color   Value
B     Black   0
N     Brown   1
R     Red     2
O     Orange  3
Y     Yellow  4
G     Green   5
E     Blue    6
V     Violet  7
A     Gray    8
W     White   9
Resistance of Y V R = 4.700000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of B N O = 1.000000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of A W O = 89.000000 kilo-ohms
Resistance of G B E = 50.000000 mega-ohms
